"">Objective: This 21 day email course is designed for the student to gain =
a clear understanding of the credit repair process so that they can approac=
h the client file and create an action plan with certainty. The content of =
this course is also designed to help the student effectively communicate cr=
edit information so that as a business owner they can feel comfortable and =
confident when speaking about the subject of credit to leads, clients, and =
the general public.<br></span></i><div style=3D"margin: 0; outline: none; p=
